use flake

# Secrets live outside the repository. `.envrc` is tracked, so anything
# written here ends up in the history; `.envrc.local` is gitignored and holds
# `TEDDIEBOX_SLIX_PASSWORD`, the SLIX privacy password built into the image.
# `TEDDIEBOX_LANGUAGE` picks which of the card's four sets of system sounds the
# box speaks: `de`, `en-gb`, `en-us` or `fr`. It belongs in `.envrc.local`
# rather than here, because it is a property of one box rather than of the
# project, and unset means German. An unrecognised value fails the build.
# `TEDDIEBOX_STOCK_DUMP` names a full flash dump of a stock box, for the tests
# that read it. The dump is the box's own, so it is set in `.envrc.local`.
source_env_if_exists .envrc.local
